From 7f5077d938edfb6f60d9f7f905aa82d24d7fbb66 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tim <107831991+SyntaxError-PEBKAC@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:07:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 10/22] ducksteps: fix installer wizard bitmap artifacts

wizWatermark.bmp had a jagged circular edge and wizHeader.bmp cut off
mid-arc with visible dithering, both from a lossy downscale of the
original art. Rebuilt both from the existing clean about-logo/
background assets: watermark keeps the duck badge on a plain starry
sky (floating ring removed per feedback), header centers the badge
with a starfield redrawn to match the sparkle style already inside
the badge artwork.
---
 browser/branding/ducksteps/wizHeader.bmp    | Bin 25818 -> 25818 bytes
 browser/branding/ducksteps/wizHeaderRTL.bmp | Bin 25818 -> 25818 bytes
 browser/branding/ducksteps/wizWatermark.bmp | Bin 154542 -> 154542 bytes
 3 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)

diff --git a/browser/branding/ducksteps/wizHeader.bmp b/browser/branding/ducksteps/wizHeader.bmp
index f0be4147c17ee1365fc2a7471bad80e87e7b37cc..6299334ae55f0a2e13b826259f8f172158ed1c88 100644
